  "releaseNotes": "1.0.4\n- Update Entity Framework Core dependencies from 10.0.8 to 10.0.9. No code or public API changes.\n\n1.0.3\n- Rename the package, assembly, and root namespace from `DuckDB.EFCoreDriver.NTS` to `DuckDB.EFCoreProvider.NTS`, tracking the core package rename. Replace `using DuckDB.EFCoreDriver.NTS...` with `using DuckDB.EFCoreProvider.NTS...`. No behavioural or public API changes beyond the names.\n\n1.0.2\n- Ship the IntelliSense XML documentation file in the package. No code changes.\n\n1.0.1\n- Initial NetTopologySuite spatial support for DuckDB.EFCoreProvider.",
